From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:43:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: macsmc: Add the T8015 function switch regulators

Register the SMC function switch regulators on T8015, where the
iPhone 8 Plus switches its touch controller core rail through the SMC.
Boards that do not describe them leave the node disabled.

Originally from iPhOmarchy patches/0040 ("input: apple_z2: D21 SMC function
rail control + iOS-order power cycle", b2533c59a2a0) and patches/0041
("input: apple_z2: D21 SMC rail-state probe (RW) + smc_on_retries",
b570c134309f), iPhOmarchy 5921728.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/mfd/macsmc.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c b/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
index 08f7b6c8e..e9aee92f6 100644
--- a/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@ static const struct mfd_cell apple_smc_t8015_devs[] = {
 	MFD_CELL_OF("macsmc-gpio", NULL, NULL, 0, 0, "apple,smc-gpio"),
 	MFD_CELL_OF("macsmc-hwmon", NULL, NULL, 0, 0, "apple,smc-hwmon"),
 	MFD_CELL_OF("macsmc-reboot", NULL, NULL, 0, 0, "apple,t8015-smc-reboot"),
+	MFD_CELL_OF("macsmc-regulator", NULL, NULL, 0, 0, "apple,smc-regulators"),
 };
 
 static const struct mfd_cell apple_smc_t8103_devs[] = {
